 "description": "<p>A wearable butterfly that flutters where it counts: this rose-line vibrator straps the classic butterfly shape onto dual motors, one locked on the G-spot and one resting against the clitoris, and runs each side on its own control. Nine G-spot modes and nine teasing clit modes can be mixed, matched, or run one at a time, so the same toy covers slow warm-ups and fast finishes without fiddling.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Smart_Remote_Butterfly_Vibrator_1\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/3_92f05869-2e28-450c-a8cd-05d304050150_480x480.jpg?v=1700730924\"></p>\n<p>The bundled remote works from up to ten meters away, which is the whole point of a butterfly like this one. Hand the remote to a partner across the room, or keep it in your own palm for lazy control mid-session. At 166g and 152mm by 30mm, it sits light against the body and disappears into a bag afterward.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Smart_Remote_Butterfly_Vibrator_2\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/5_5a56636a-7d0e-445d-b846-ae9ea42bb915_480x480.jpg?v=1700730934\"></p>\n<p>The raised texture on the shaft and the ergonomic curve do the aiming for you, and the magnetic USB cable snaps into place without forcing a plug into a port.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Smart_Remote_Butterfly_Vibrator_3\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/4_c75292b2-118b-479a-a010-aab37ff037ff_480x480.jpg?v=1700730931\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Motors: dual, independently controlled</li>\n<li>Modes: 9 G-spot + 9 clitoral</li>\n<li>Remote range: up to 10 meters</li>\n<li>Size: 152 x 30 mm; weight 166 g</li>\n<li>Charging: magnetic USB</li>\n<li>Waterproof: IPX6</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"Smart_Remote_Butterfly_Vibrator_4\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/7_480x480.jpg?v=1700730938\"><br />\n<img alt=\"Smart_Remote_Butterfly_Vibrator_5\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/8_480x480.jpg?v=1700730942\"><br />\n<img alt=\"Smart_Remote_Butterfly_Vibrator_6\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/6_1260b1a9-5b01-405f-9389-6f7bd0044fca_480x480.jpg?v=1700730946\"></p>\n<p>Shower-safe, quiet at hand, and rinsed clean in a minute — a butterfly built for regular rotation.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Wearable rose butterfly vibrator with dual motors, 9+9 modes, 10 m remote, magnetic USB charging and IPX6 waterproof body.</p>\n",
